{
  "description": "Tempo de queries SQL por rota HTTP — via OpenTelemetry traces (SQLAlchemy instrumentation)",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "content": "## Como funciona\nEste dashboard usa **traces do Tempo** (não métricas). O OTel SQLAlchemy instrumentation adiciona um span para cada query com:\n- `db.system` = `postgresql`\n- `db.statement` = a query SQL executada\n- `duration` = tempo de execução\n\nClique em qualquer linha da tabela para abrir o **trace completo** e ver a rota HTTP que originou a query.\n\n> Execute `./demo.sh` para gerar dados.",
      "gridPos":{"h":4,"w":24,"x":0,"y":0},"id":1,
      "options":{"content":"","mode":"markdown"},"title":"","type":"text"
    },

    {"collapsed":false,"gridPos":{"h":1,"w":24,"x":0,"y":4},"id":2,"title":"Queries Recentes (SQLAlchemy → PostgreSQL)","type":"row"},
    {
      "datasource":{"type":"tempo","uid":"tempo"},
      "gridPos":{"h":16,"w":24,"x":0,"y":5},"id":10,
      "options":{"frameType":"spanList"},
      "title":"Spans de DB — clique para abrir o trace completo","type":"table",
      "targets":[{
        "datasource":{"type":"tempo","uid":"tempo"},
        "queryType":"traceql",
        "query":"{span.db.system=\"postgresql\"} | select(resource.service.name, span.db.statement, span.db.operation, duration)",
        "tableType":"spans",
        "limit":50,
        "refId":"A"
      }],
      "transformations":[
        {"id":"organize","options":{"renameByName":{
          "traceIdHidden":"Trace ID",
          "resource.service.name":"Serviço",
          "span.db.statement":"Query SQL",
          "span.db.operation":"Operação",
          "duration":"Duração (ms)",
          "startTime":"Horário"
        },"indexByName":{"startTime":0,"resource.service.name":1,"span.db.operation":2,"duration":3,"span.db.statement":4}}}
      ]
    },

    {"collapsed":false,"gridPos":{"h":1,"w":24,"x":0,"y":21},"id":3,"title":"Queries em Requests Lentos — trace total > 200ms","type":"row"},
    {
      "datasource":{"type":"tempo","uid":"tempo"},
      "gridPos":{"h":16,"w":24,"x":0,"y":22},"id":20,
      "options":{"frameType":"spanList"},
      "title":"DB Spans em requests lentos (traceDuration > 200ms) — clique para ver a rota HTTP","type":"table",
      "targets":[{
        "datasource":{"type":"tempo","uid":"tempo"},
        "queryType":"traceql",
        "query":"{span.db.system=\"postgresql\" && traceDuration > 200ms} | select(resource.service.name, span.db.statement, span.db.operation, duration)",
        "tableType":"spans",
        "limit":30,
        "refId":"A"
      }],
      "transformations":[
        {"id":"organize","options":{"renameByName":{
          "traceIdHidden":"Trace ID",
          "resource.service.name":"Serviço",
          "span.db.statement":"Query SQL",
          "span.db.operation":"Operação",
          "duration":"Duração (ms)",
          "startTime":"Horário"
        },"indexByName":{"duration":0,"resource.service.name":1,"span.db.operation":2,"startTime":3,"span.db.statement":4}}}
      ]
    },

    {"collapsed":false,"gridPos":{"h":1,"w":24,"x":0,"y":38},"id":4,"title":"Trace Completo — HTTP Route → DB Query","type":"row"},
    {
      "datasource":{"type":"tempo","uid":"tempo"},
      "gridPos":{"h":16,"w":24,"x":0,"y":39},"id":30,
      "options":{"frameType":"traceList"},
      "title":"Traces que incluem chamadas ao PostgreSQL","type":"table",
      "targets":[{
        "datasource":{"type":"tempo","uid":"tempo"},
        "queryType":"traceql",
        "query":"{resource.service.name=~\"barbearia-service|agendamento-service\" && span.db.system=\"postgresql\"}",
        "tableType":"traces",
        "limit":30,
        "refId":"A"
      }],
      "transformations":[
        {"id":"organize","options":{"renameByName":{
          "traceID":"Trace ID",
          "rootServiceName":"Serviço",
          "rootTraceName":"Rota HTTP",
          "duration":"Duração Total (ms)",
          "startTime":"Horário"
        }}}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
